<title>SINGAPORE: Republic Hotels sees better second half.</title>
<headline>Republic Hotels sees better second half.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Hotels and Resorts Ltd said on Wednesday it expected its second half performance to improve over the first half of the year.</p>
<p>The group reported net profits for the first six months ended June 30, 1997 had plunged 31.1 percent to Singapore $6.97 million.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it would continue to &quot;increase the customer base of its hotels and seek further operating efficiencies.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (+65-870-3080)</p>
</text>
